    "items": [
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "To the chief Musician, to Jeduthun, A Psalm of Asaph."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "I Cried unto God with my voice,",
          "Even unto God with my voice; and he gave ear unto me."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "In the day of my trouble I sought the Lord:",
          "My sore ran in the night, and ceased not: My soul refused to be comforted."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "I remembered God, and was troubled:",
          "I complained, and my spirit was overwhelmed."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Selah."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Thou holdest mine eyes waking:",
          "I am so troubled that I cannot speak."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "I have considered the days of old,",
          "The years of ancient times."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "I call to remembrance my song in the night:",
          "I commune with mine own heart: And my spirit made diligent search."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Will the Lord cast off for ever?",
          "And will he be favourable no more?"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Is his mercy clean gone for ever?",
          "Doth his promise fail for evermore?"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          9
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Hath God forgotten to be gracious?",
          "Hath he in anger shut up his tender mercies?"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Selah."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          10
        ],
        "lines": [
          "And I said, This is my infirmity:",
          "But I will remember the years of the right hand of the Most High."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          11
        ],
        "lines": [
          "I will remember the works of the LORD:",
          "Surely I will remember thy wonders of old."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          12
        ],
        "lines": [
          "I will meditate also of all thy work,",
          "And talk of thy doings."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          13
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Thy way, O God, is in the sanctuary:",
          "Who is so great a God as our God?"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          14
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Thou art the God that doest wonders:",
          "Thou hast declared thy strength among the people."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          15
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Thou hast with thine arm redeemed thy people,",
          "The sons of Jacob and Joseph."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Selah."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          16
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The waters saw thee, O God, the waters saw thee; they were afraid:",
          "The depths also were troubled."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          17
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The clouds poured out water: The skies sent out a sound:",
          "Thine arrows also went abroad."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          18
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The voice of thy thunder was in the heaven:",
          "The lightnings lightened the world: The earth trembled and shook."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          19
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Thy way is in the sea, and thy path in the great waters,",
          "And thy footsteps are not known."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          20
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Thou leddest thy people like a flock",
          "By the hand of Moses and Aaron."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": [],
        "np": true
      }
    ]
  },
